WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.820
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.880
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.400
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.540
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.100
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.290
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.360
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.450
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:58.210
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.490
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.420
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.870
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.180
Takara Fansubs

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:30.040
<i>I want to meet Madam Isabella!</i>

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:34.470
<i>Sensing she might not have long to live,</i>

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.540
<i>...Angeletta cherished this last dream.</i>

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.010
<i>In order to fulfill this dream,</i>

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:43.470
<i>...Romeo made his way into the Montoverni mansion with Angeletta.</i>

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:48.980
<i>But Lady Isabella coldly turned her away.</i>

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:53.880
Episode 23:

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:53.880
Farewell, My Angel

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:03.130
I have no intention of acknowledging you as my heiress.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.490
There is nothing more to say.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.960
Now go home.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:13.050
Wait!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:17.590
Don't you want to know why Angeletta had to come here?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.600
Angeletta's health is...

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:22.920
Romeo...

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:25.960
But...

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.590
I understand.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:32.380
We won't bother you any more.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.850
My dream has been fulfilled just by meeting you, Grandmother.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:42.930
Your face and your voice will remain locked forever in my heart.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.650
A gift from Father in Heaven.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.820
My, for me?

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:15.200
Remember me whenever you hear it, Mother. Remember that I love you.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.190
...that I love you.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.400
Please keep this by your side.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.270
I'd be so happy if you could just do that.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.830
Put it down there.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.420
Yes.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:42.800
Farewell, Bacchus.
Farewell, Madam Isabella.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.560
May you be happy, Madam Isabella.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.220
I'm not mistaken.
That was the right thing to do.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:11.080
It was my DUTY to do that, Adolf.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:29.330
She had beautiful eyes, too...
just like Adolf's.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.710
I'm sorry for forcing you to bring me here, Romeo.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.810
I felt I had to come.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.510
It's okay. But you should rest for a bit.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.540
Thank you.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:00.430
Umm, Angeletta, why did you give that music box to Mrs. Isabella?

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.460
I wanted to return it to her.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.600
I don't know how long I have to live.

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.100
Angeletta!

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.890
I don't know when God will call me to his side...

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.030
...but if it's soon,

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.370
...please, Romeo... don't lose your usual smile.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.830
But I couldn't do that!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.140
Romeo... I'm very happy tonight.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.530
You've fulfilled my dream.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.450
I love you.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:38.170
Because you came into my life, my dream was fulfilled.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.470
So I don't want to hear any more sad words.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.180
I won't have anything to be sad about anymore!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.390
No, you mustn't cry!

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.300
Angeletta, you're crying too.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.000
You're right...

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.530
I... I really believe you'll get better.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:07.170
So I promise I won't cry any more.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.230
Romeo... I was praying a moment ago.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.760
I asked God to please protect my grandmother.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.740
Angeletta...

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:24.810
I can tell... that she loves Father even now.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:29.190
Grandmother is a sensitive, wonderful person.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:33.030
I can tell.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.580
But for the moment...

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.400
Right now, she's all alone.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:54.800
So I asked God to take care of her... my beloved Grandmother.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.380
That's all I can do.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:03.360
I... love you... Grandmother.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.460
Angeletta!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:08.490
Angeletta! What's wrong?

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.260
Angeletta!

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.220
Angeletta!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.840
Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:21.340
I love you... Grandmother...

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:24.320
Angeletta! Angeletta!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.520
Romeo! Look what you've done!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.500
What did she ever do to you?

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.320
I wasn't careful enough.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.230
Romeo was doing it for Angeletta...
- It's my fault.

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.590
I should have been more careful.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.870
So that's the meaning of 'devoted friendship' to you Black Brothers:

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.220
...making her collapse like that!

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:58.220
Romeo, if anything should happen to her, it'll be your fault!

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.410
I know... Doctor Casella!

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.020
He's running away!

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.700
Wait!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.640
What's the idea?

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.100
He'll apologize as much as you want afterwards...

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:15.450
But let him do as he wants for now.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.220
Please!

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:18.870
<i>Oh God...</i>

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.470
<i>I beg you...</i>

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.560
<i>Please spare Angeletta!</i>

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.690
How is she, Doctor?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.090
I've done everything I can.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.480
But...

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.470
But?

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:48.030
It'll be dangerous if she remains in this coma for too long.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:53.190
But it's uncanny... what a peaceful expression she has.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.920
Piccolo...

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:03.420
Angeletta won't die of any stupid illness...
She'll make it.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.710
Paris? In France?

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.930
Among my friends there I know a heart specialist.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.970
He may be able to do something for her.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.490
We shouldn't delay even a day.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:21.560
Wow. I'd sure like to visit France.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.530
Anzelmo!

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.670
Doctor, we're very grateful,

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:29.360
...but please forget we even had this conversation.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:33.370
There's no way in the world we could come up with the money.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:34.850
Isn't that so, dear?

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.890
Send Angeletta to a doctor in France?

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.350
Yes, they might be able to cure her there...

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.850
Very well then.
How much will you need?

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.000
As much as I gave you the other day, I presume.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.850
That's not what I meant!

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:59.360
I'd sell our house first if that's what it took to send her to France!

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:05.380
I don't care if it takes our last penny to get Angeletta healed...

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:11.260
No, the reason I came here today is to ask you another favor.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.010
Romeo told me about this last night.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:22.570
I was thinking Angeletta might have a place in your heart now, Madam...

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:28.010
So I want to ask if you'll please come see her again.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:32.310
Madam Isabella, please be honest with yourself.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:36.040
Otherwise, it'll be a repeat of what happened when Adolf died...

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.230
How rude!

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.630
Madam!

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.790
We have a problem...

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.180
All the chimney sweeps in Milan have gathered at our front gate!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.020
Perfect. Just as planned.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.720
Every chimney is stopped up tight.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:13.200
Madam Isabella! Please listen to us!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:16.220
We won't help you until you do!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:20.670
Those boys must have clogged up the chimneys.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:29.860
Romeo!

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:33.850
Romeo, come quick! Alfredo and the others have...

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.660
What're you doing?! Get to work!

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.570
Hey! Move it!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.130
We're not budging an inch!

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.170
Who's responsible?

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.800
I am.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:51.790
Stand up.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:52.700
Yes, Ma'am.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:54.680
Your name?

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.380
Alfredo.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:02.330
Now, Alfredo, won't you explain your purpose in making such a scene?

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:05.240
I'm sorry about that.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:09.320
But you've got to listen to what Romeo has to say.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:13.200
Romeo? So this is his doing?

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.970
No! Romeo had no hand in this!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.640
That's right!
- We're doing this 'cause we want to!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:19.810
Hold your tongue!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.100
Cherbio.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.340
Yes?
- Throw these children out.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.710
Madam Isabella, wait!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.710
You heard what Madam said.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.190
Get out of here.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.940
Go home, now. Hurry up.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.470
Hmph! Some grandmother Madam Isabella is!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:48.900
Yeah! My grandmother looked after me all night when I caught a cold.

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:53.090
My grandmother always makes warm milk for me.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:57.700
Name me one time you've even been nice to Angeletta!

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:01.220
My grandmother's much better than you!
- He's right!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.420
Damn straight!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.180
Right!
- Right!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.340
You're no good, Madam Isabella!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.620
How dare you be so rude!
- Wait!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:15.110
Don't. It would only make Angeletta sad to hear you say that.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.640
Angeletta loves Madam Isabella.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:25.850
She told me just thinking about her grandmother makes her happy...

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:32.830
I've thought about it... She may have money, and an estate...

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.860
But she's all alone.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:40.570
The only one who really cares about Madam Isabella is Angeletta.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.220
Romeo.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:53.000
Madam Isabella!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:55.600
Madam Isabella!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.700
I'll ask you one more time, Madam Isabella.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.020
Please come see Angeletta.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.050
Please!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.520
Why?

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:10.700
Why do you all make such an effort for Angeletta?

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.400
Easy! 'Cause she's the nicest person ever, that's why.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.850
And she saved Romeo's life.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.410
We owe our lives to anybody Romeo owes his to.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.480
He's a great guy.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.310
Though he's a little soft in the head.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.520
Hey!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:32.830
Romeo and Angeletta have always stood by each other.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.030
They've shared the happy times and the sad.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:37.610
Romeo protected Angeletta...

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:41.230
And Angeletta never lost her smile because Romeo was there.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.180
I have friends, too.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.720
The Black Brothers here.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:51.260
Because they're there, I'm not lonely. I'm not alone.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:56.940
Madam Isabella, Angeletta...
Angeletta is prepared.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:01.930
She told me she might have to rejoin her father and mother soon.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.450
And yet she was always kind to everybody.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:11.290
Always putting others ahead of herself in her prayers.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:15.390
Madam Isabella, please save Angeletta!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.020
Please save our angel!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:18.940
Please!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.010
Please, Madam Isabella!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.720
What could I possibly do now?

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:34.150
You have the only thing she really wants.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.400
What does she want?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.310
Your smile, Madam Isabella.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:55.050
Thank you, Romeo. You taught me what's really more important.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:00.690
And you taught me how precious friendship can be.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:07.450
Romeo, show me the way to this precious angel of yours.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.200
Yes!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.570
Did it!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:16.690
Doctor, what will happen to my daughter?

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:24.380
It's strange. It's as if she had no will to live.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:29.870
You mean... you mean she'll stay like this until...?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.730
How is Angeletta?

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:37.080
Dear!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.080
That can't be!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.270
Romeo!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.400
Madam Isabella!

00:16:58.440 --> 00:16:59.410
Angeletta...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.430
Angeletta!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.070
Grandmother.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:16.800
I'm sorry for leaving you alone for so long.

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.420
Please forgive me.

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:25.060
It's not a dream.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:32.090
Angeletta, I'll never let you go again!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.890
Grandmother!

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:43.510
A miracle... it's a miracle, dear God.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:50.170
Rossi, I can't express how grateful I am to you.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:54.270
You've shown me I've been mistaken all these years.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.880
But I was right about one thing.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.670
To have trusted you all these years.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:07.740
Madam! Come on. I'm... I'm just a worthless old goat.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.510
Doctor Casella, wasn't it?

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:12.520
Yes.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:17.240
So they may be able to cure her illness in Paris?

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:22.150
Yes. There's a chance. A better chance than she has here.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:25.190
I see. Then let's go to Paris.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:29.620
With whatever life is left me, I'll protect this child.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:31.780
Thank you, Grandmother.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.650
But until then...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:41.200
Won't you stay here in this house with my beloved father and mother?

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:44.660
Of course, Angeletta.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.190
That's a relief, Piccolo.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.170
A real relief.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.640
But it's going to get lonely.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:06.700
Romeo.

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.330
Angeletta!

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.260
Are you sure you're well enough to be up and about?

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:15.290
I'm okay. I wanted to talk to you.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.700
Have a seat.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.330
So... tomorrow it's goodbye.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.780
We went through a lot.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.190
A lot of hardships, too.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.780
But I only remember your smile now.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:38.390
I've enjoyed every bit of it.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.910
Me too, Angeletta.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:57.060
I won't forget you, Romeo...

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.230
...or the blue sky you showed my heart.

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:08.330
<i><i>What kind of glorious skies,</i></i>

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:13.570
<i><i>Did you see, I wonder,</i></i>

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:20.650
<i><i>While you were growing up,</i></i>

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:28.740
<i><i>With those beautiful eyes?</i></i>

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:39.140
<i><i>But my vista of the world,</i></i>

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:47.760
<i><i>Is only as much as my window shows me.</i></i>

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:54.610
<i><i>If only I could give myself to the wind,</i></i>

00:20:54.830 --> 00:21:00.100
<i><i>Quietly closing my eyes,</i></i>

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:06.490
<i><i>My thoughts lifted into the distance,</i></i>

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:13.080
<i><i>On the wings of the angels.</i></i>

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:29.220
<i><i>Please tell me all about you... again.</i></i>

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.450
Romeo!

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.950
Angeletta!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.860
Goodbye... Goodbye, Romeo!

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.000
Angeletta!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.130
<i>Farewell, my angel.</i>

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:58.870
<i>At a hotel where I was cleaning the chimney,</i>

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.490
<i>I met a girl trying to escape out of the window.</i>

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:06.820
<i>Bianca? You're Alfredo's sister?</i>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.550
See you then!

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.550
<i>The Hunted Siblings</i>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.550
Next time:

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:17.740
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:34.750
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:38.950
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:43.150
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:48.060
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:48.060 --> 00:22:51.960
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:59.260
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:04.860
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:09.060
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
